  "label": "Violence-Joke Equivalence",
  "description": "The meme falsely equates the act of telling a joke with the act of killing, and then attributes the violence to the offended group's reaction. This is a logical fallacy that ignores the complex causes of violence and instead blames a specific group for any violent outcome, regardless of context or causation.",
